{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "plan-build-verify",
  "revision": 3,
  "name": "Plan, build, verify",
  "description": "Plan the change, build it, then review the implementation and checks. Each agent passes its written handoff to the next step.",
  "status": "draft",
  "input_schema": null,
  "output_contract": {
    "schema": {
      "type": "inline",
      "name": "written_handoff",
      "schema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "source": {
      "type": "node_output",
      "node_id": "verify",
      "pointer": ""
    },
    "strict": false
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "input",
      "name": "Request",
      "type": "input",
      "config": {
        "defaults": {
          "attachments": []
        }
      },
      "input_bindings": [],
      "output_schema": null,
      "retry": {
        "max_attempts": 1,
        "retry_on": []
      },
      "metadata": {
        "editor": {
          "position": {
            "x": 60,
            "y": 80
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "plan",
      "name": "Plan",
      "type": "agent",
      "config": {
        "instructions": "Investigate the request and write an actionable implementation plan in ordinary text or Markdown. The next agent receives your final message but not your exploration history. Preserve relevant user requirements, answers, decisions, code findings, file paths and symbols. Give ordered implementation steps with acceptance checks and risks. Distinguish optional ideas from required work. Do not implement the change. No JSON or fixed response schema is required.",
        "tools": {
          "type": "inherit"
        },
        "context_mode": "isolated_child",
        "structured_output": "text",
        "profile": {
          "id": "plan"
        }
      },
      "input_bindings": [
        {
          "target": "request",
          "source": {
            "type": "run_input",
            "pointer": "/request"
          }
        }
      ],
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "inline",
        "name": "written_handoff",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "retry": {
        "max_attempts": 1,
        "retry_on": []
      },
      "metadata": {
        "editor": {
          "position": {
            "x": 380,
            "y": 80
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "name": "Build",
      "type": "agent",
      "config": {
        "instructions": "Implement the request following the supplied plan. Read the entire plan and use its ordered steps as a checklist. Use its findings for targeted file reads, then make the required changes. Do not replace implementation with another proposal. Read before editing, preserve existing work, follow project conventions and respect tool permissions. Adapt the plan only when the actual code requires it and explain why. Run relevant tests or other checks and fix recoverable failures. Finish with a written handoff describing what happened for each plan step, files changed, checks actually run and their results, deviations and remaining work. Clearly explain any blocker or unsuccessful attempt. Never imply unfinished or unverified work succeeded. The next agent receives this message, not your tool history. Use ordinary text or Markdown; no JSON format is required.",
        "tools": {
          "type": "inherit"
        },
        "context_mode": "isolated_child",
        "structured_output": "text",
        "profile": {
          "id": "build"
        }
      },
      "input_bindings": [
        {
          "target": "request",
          "source": {
            "type": "run_input",
            "pointer": "/request"
          }
        },
        {
          "target": "plan",
          "source": {
            "type": "node_output",
            "node_id": "plan",
            "pointer": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "inline",
        "name": "written_handoff",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "retry": {
        "max_attempts": 1,
        "retry_on": []
      },
      "metadata": {
        "editor": {
          "position": {
            "x": 700,
            "y": 80
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verify",
      "name": "Verify",
      "type": "agent",
      "config": {
        "instructions": "Review the original request, the plan and the Build handoff against the actual workspace. Inspect relevant code and run appropriate tests or checks with the available tools. Do not merely accept the Build claims. Do not edit files or run destructive commands. Check each required plan step and identify omissions, regressions and unverified claims. Finish with a clear written verdict: what was verified with evidence, what failed or remains blocked, and precise next actions. A blocked or incomplete build must be reported as such, not approved. Use ordinary text or Markdown; no JSON or status field is required.",
        "tools": {
          "type": "inherit"
        },
        "context_mode": "isolated_child",
        "structured_output": "text"
      },
      "input_bindings": [
        {
          "target": "request",
          "source": {
            "type": "run_input",
            "pointer": "/request"
          }
        },
        {
          "target": "plan",
          "source": {
            "type": "node_output",
            "node_id": "plan",
            "pointer": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "target": "build",
          "source": {
            "type": "node_output",
            "node_id": "build",
            "pointer": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "inline",
        "name": "written_handoff",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "retry": {
        "max_attempts": 1,
        "retry_on": []
      },
      "metadata": {
        "editor": {
          "position": {
            "x": 1020,
            "y": 80
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
